                        <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>9.4 Governing Law &amp; Dispute Resolution:</strong> The Parties shall resolve any dispute amicably in good faith within thirty (30) days, failing which the Agreement shall be governed by the <strong><%- e($agr['governing_law']) %></strong>, under the jurisdiction of the <strong><%- e($agr['dispute_forum']) %></strong>.</p>
